---
title: Will you be there?
# Where the answer links of an invite or reminder email land:
# /rsvp/?t=<signed token>&a=yes|maybe|no. rsvp.js shows the event and
# records the answer (a POST from the page, so mail scanners that open
# links answer nothing). Not indexed and not in the sitemap.
permalink: /rsvp/
noindex: true
excludeFromSitemap: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
meetHead: true
seoTitle: 'Will you be there? | AI Safety for Italy'
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% block content %}
<section class="page-hero meet-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Ci sarai? · Will you be there?</span>
    <h1 id="rsvpTitle"><span class="skeleton skeleton-title" aria-hidden="true"></span></h1>
    <div class="meet-meta" id="rsvpMeta"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="meet-main">
  <div class="container">
    <div id="rsvpView" class="rsvp-view"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="/assets/js/meet/common.js?v={{ build }}" defer></script>
<script src="/assets/js/meet/rsvp.js?v={{ build }}" defer></script>
{% endblock %}
